{"record_id": "6be69876fa95c1908ee3a6026ddc14f85cc333c66df156a7b06744bbb9da3a2a", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331147", "node_id": "44331147", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331147_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Unless the provisions or the context otherwise require, these general provisions, rules of construction and definitions shall govern the construction of this code. The provisions of this code and all proceedings under it are to be construed with a view to effect its objects and to promote justice.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1300)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "776e135ea2e2b7ef767e460ea66e2a47a0428b7050244a3f1b1092c3d0245094", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331148", "node_id": "44331148", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331148_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Title, chapter, section, and subsection headings contained in this chapter shall not be deemed to govern, limit, modify or in any manner affect the scope, meaning or intent of the provisions of any title, chapter, section or subsection of this chapter.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1301)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "94e48464ad42114b598ef3e559d31bc13c223a04f8d65963be36174f44144633", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331149", "node_id": "44331149", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331149_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">This code shall refer only to the omission or commission of acts within the territorial limits of the city and to that territory outside of the city over which the city has jurisdiction or control by virtue of the constitution, or any law, or by reason of ownership or control of property.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1302)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "d2744d953cc4910ae490e66062bee8fbd1e4511a5c8593b480ce3741946719a7", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331150", "node_id": "44331150", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331150_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Whenever in this code any act or omission is made unlawful, it shall include causing, permitting, aiding, abetting, suffering or concealing such act or omission.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1303)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "4d4b1f1e673f76d3af49550d3e26bd6e8cd25f890fdfef6d6c009066265e4b6d", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331151", "node_id": "44331151", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331151_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Whenever in this code a power is granted to or a duty is imposed upon a public officer or employee, the power may be exercised or the duty may be performed by a deputy of such officer or employee or by a person otherwise duly authorized pursuant to law or ordinance, or by an officer of the County of Los Angeles, or by a deputy or employee of such officer when by contract with the City of Malibu such officer is obligated and has agreed to perform certain duties on behalf of the city, unless this code expressly provides otherwise.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1304)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "f0d210154f1c47c47fe3932b2c2ade759a37235fe44bde0d68729ce9eee3107c", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331152", "node_id": "44331152", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331152_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Writing includes any form of recorded message capable of comprehension by ordinary visual means. Whenever any notice, report, statement or record is required or authorized by this code, it shall be made in writing in the English language unless it is expressly provided otherwise.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1305)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "75ecd038b77c55aec96ac120ba676ac84e8fca7a0db40f17cc1eac6069a49b02", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331153", "node_id": "44331153", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331153_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Whenever a reference is made to any portion of this code, or to any ordinance of this city, the reference applies to all amendments and additions now or hereafter made.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1306)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "46918971ae1481d12d8816f04de2ffe79c0303c09c0e8ebddfca76ff01e77f93", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331154", "node_id": "44331154", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331154_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Whenever a notice is required to be given under this code, unless different provisions herein are otherwise specifically made, such notice may be given either by personal delivery thereof to the person to be notified or by deposit in the United States mail in a sealed envelope, postage prepaid, addressed to such person to be notified, at his or her last known business or residence address as the same appears in the public records of the city or other records pertaining to the matter to which such notice is directed. Service by mail shall be deemed to have been completed at the time of deposit in the post office.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1307)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "79001461537cd32af88950ebe6bfb5acd7ad336363ed3908923f67b23d97d1f1", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331155", "node_id": "44331155", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331155_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Proof of giving any notice may be made by the certificate of any officer or employee of the city, or by affidavit or declaration under penalty of perjury as provided by the California Code of Civil Procedure Section <a href=\"https://municipal.codes/CA/CCP/2015.5\">2015.5</a>. of any person over the age of 18 years, which shows service in conformity with this code, or other provisions of law applicable to the subject matter concerned.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1308)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "68e6d6706e6d1b74f4f3f0d23ebed1a82c6e64898d13f47bc16ab56677771617", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331156", "node_id": "44331156", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331156_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">The present tense includes the past and future tenses, and the future, the present.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1309)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "c0289d9664f4e86777a37e216cddb2c977fbdef67bae167202ac138c5edeef6d", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331157", "node_id": "44331157", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331157_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">The masculine gender includes the feminine and neuter.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1310)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "07045b931427a82dccf70a6bb540e18eb6a76172007632ef3e3ae67e0e579bad", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331158", "node_id": "44331158", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331158_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">The singular number includes the plural, and the plural, the singular.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1311)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "311400b3f34c3b2c301b09419c5f27069615adcd965a90de5ca9671e55d7e69d", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331159", "node_id": "44331159", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331159_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Shall&quot; is mandatory and &quot;may&quot; is permissive unless the context requires otherwise.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1312)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "de75f7f5752322073629ea25c3dbcb001addd16f367ea07a0bdea71f1c24b81c", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331160", "node_id": "44331160", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331160_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Oath&quot; includes affirmation.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1313)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "c017b4d306d18267b3dc17aa734e150cbb4891f7506c902ed02b7f6d3a185ab6", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331161", "node_id": "44331161", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331161_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Person&quot; as used in this code or in any ordinance or code adopted hereby, includes any person, firm, association, organization, partnership, business trust, company or corporation, and any municipal, political or governmental corporation, district, body or agency, other than the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1314)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "1974839bedd781a080a7fa8bb4d40e3b63dbbf5dbba3f9227b26b77d5a95a623", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331162", "node_id": "44331162", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331162_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;State&quot; is the state of California.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1315)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "540e8c223934f39868cb773e6184ef0721e7db1195a5fe557987b1e61e06224a", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331163", "node_id": "44331163", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331163_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;County&quot; is the county of Los Angeles.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1316)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "a8fd925ee651bb18757d2fffba202632f73c4597e939b5acbf671d2c8bf45579", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331164", "node_id": "44331164", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331164_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;City&quot; is the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1317)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "5871cdaf926be83f4caa399d23917815d7171e4bd44b67c58fd5291bf231b0e7", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331165", "node_id": "44331165", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331165_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">The use of the title of any officer, employee, or official shall mean such officer, employee, or official of the city of Malibu, or his or her duly authorized representative.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1318)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "ff878c9b908396de03da2b583073caac8d74c09ff96f72da90d2d0d0432e0f4e", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331166", "node_id": "44331166", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331166_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Council&quot; is the city council of the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1319)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "f70a198956f6017913eb49f4b738d08ea7e0f46ae5bb664a2b7a75c0c8fefa34", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331167", "node_id": "44331167", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331167_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Street&quot; includes all streets, highways, avenues, lanes, alleys, courts, places, squares, sidewalks, parkways, curbs or other public ways in this city which have been or may hereafter be dedicated and open to public use and accepted by resolution of the city council, or such other public property as designated in any law of this state.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1320)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "a37779692910da382b178902ada5c827770d983017589b2b52b3543a3b3b10d2", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331168", "node_id": "44331168", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331168_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Owner&quot; applied to a building or land, shall include any part owner, joint owner, tenant, tenant in common, joint tenant, of the whole or a part of such building or land.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1321)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "da59619371aecbed7e28b6cc0a55ad84f3525140c54de7a54f92ae4e75b4f644", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331169", "node_id": "44331169", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331169_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Tenant&quot; or &quot;occupant&quot; as used in reference to a building or land shall include any person who occupies the whole or part of such building or land, whether alone or with others.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1322)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "a34361dcfeeeeaadc50120a178d8027408b4488c0d3015343a4ca035c7828493", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331170", "node_id": "44331170", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331170_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Sale&quot; includes any sale, exchange, barter or offer for sale.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1323)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "59307bdfaeb5cb39dc54030a3f68f42a2b5f622caa9232742be536e1d1a0138f", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331171", "node_id": "44331171", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331171_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Goods&quot; includes wares or merchandise.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1324)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "394844b2c092da38cc60e66e838ede1a6069baa17e2a9e096aa6247a446895ec", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331172", "node_id": "44331172", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331172_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Operate&quot; includes carry on, keep, conduct or maintain.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1325)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "f46e6f8dd74b53e26b2d5e9d92aef474612427f26c5904b77b0f66c2bec85158", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331173", "node_id": "44331173", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331173_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">Whenever used in any ordinance, statute, or other matter which is adopted by reference, unless the context requires otherwise, the following references shall be given the following meanings:</div><div class=\"level\"><div class=\"litem\"><div><a href=\"https://ecode360.com/44331146#44331174\">A. </a></div><div class=\"litem_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;County of Los Angeles&quot; means the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div></div><div class=\"litem\"><div><a href=\"https://ecode360.com/44331146#44331175\">B. </a></div><div class=\"litem_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Board of supervisors&quot; means the city council of the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div></div><div class=\"litem\"><div><a href=\"https://ecode360.com/44331146#44331176\">C. </a></div><div class=\"litem_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Unincorporated territory&quot; means the incorporated territory of the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div></div><div class=\"litem\"><div><a href=\"https://ecode360.com/44331146#44331177\">D. </a></div><div class=\"litem_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;County&quot; means the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div></div><div class=\"litem\"><div><a href=\"https://ecode360.com/44331146#44331178\">E. </a></div><div class=\"litem_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;County officer&quot; means the appropriate or designated officer of the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div></div><div class=\"litem\"><div><a href=\"https://ecode360.com/44331146#44331179\">F. </a></div><div class=\"litem_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Public welfare commission&quot; means the city council of the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div></div><div class=\"litem\"><div><a href=\"https://ecode360.com/44331146#44331180\">G. </a></div><div class=\"litem_content content\"><div class=\"para\">&quot;Planning director&quot; means the planning director of the city of Malibu.</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1326)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
{"record_id": "b355fad3f23cb283f2bdd84783ae95b848c858937e2fcfa9853586d5455b7745", "node_key": "malibu-ca:municipal-code:44331181", "node_id": "44331181", "publication_id": "municipal-code", "source_version": "publisher-code-336335-date-2026-06-22", "locator": {"kind": "html-id", "value": "44331181_content"}, "origins": [{"artifact": "raw/6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6.html", "sha256": "6fd2c3aa87701045f82a244579f15627832a42463e071f293dd7606d89845ab6", "url": "https://ecode360.com/44331146"}], "extraction_version": "ecode360-e2e-1.1.0", "semantic_html": "<div class=\"section_content content\"><div class=\"para\">The city council may contract with the county of Los Angeles pursuant to the laws of the state of California and the Charter of the county of Los Angeles, for the performance and execution by designated county officials of the rights, powers and duties of officers, officials and employees of the city of Malibu. Whenever in this code, whether set forth in full or by adoption by reference, any power or authority is granted to an officer, official or employee, such power or authority is conferred upon the appropriate officer, official or employee of the city of Malibu or the appropriate officer, official or employee of the county of Los Angeles whose service in behalf of the city is provided for by a contract with the county of Los Angeles.</div><div class=\"history\">(Prior code § 1327)</div><div class=\"footnotes\"></div></div>", "images": []}
